* Small-signal half circuit for the left output with the node capacitances C_X, C_P and C_L
Vin1 in1 0 {vin/2}
Vin2 in2 0 {-vin/2}
GA X 0 in1 0 {gmA}
RA X 0 {r_OA}
CX X 0 {C_X}
G7 P 0 X 0 {gm7}
G2 P 0 in2 0 {gm1}
RP P 0 {r_O2||r_O7}
CP P 0 {C_P}
G5 out P 0 P {gm5}
R5 out P {r_O5}
Rdown out 0 {R_down}
CL out 0 {C_L}
.end
